  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/none?ind=5689), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1515018437), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000049994), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6205455), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/my_perfect_partner), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/5850), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=7rrn), MeToon\n\nJi Seonjae is a world-class designer. What he intends to present to the world is Hanbok.\nWhile searching for a model to wear his designs, he stumbles upon a woman named Kim Jieun.\nShe captivates Seonjae with her mysterious charm, and he, in turn, becomes enchanted by the beauty of the Hanbok she portrays.\nAs they become partners and work together in harmony, a strange feeling begins to blossom between them. What will become of their relationship?",
